Let's start by simplifying the term $1/x_k + 1$:
\begin{align*}
    x_k + 1 &= x_{k - 1}^2 + x_{k - 1} + 1 \\
            &= \left(x_{k - 1} + 1 \right) \left(x_{k - 1} + \frac{1}{x_{k - 1} + 1}\right)
\end{align*}

